    <briefdescription>
<para>Implementation of <ref refid="structllvm_1_1format__provider" kindref="compound">format_provider&lt;T&gt;</ref> for characters. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The options string of a character type has the grammar:</para>
<para>char_options :: (empty) | [integer_options]</para>
<para>If <computeroutput>char_options</computeroutput> is empty, the character is displayed as an ASCII character. Otherwise, it is treated as an integer options string. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
